id: god-of-judgment
name: God of Judgment
order: 2
optionOf: divine-magic
description: >
  If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  God of Judgment [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# Offered in a window as a Signature Technique is declared (chat.mjs answerDeclare).
[triggered/declare-maneuver, 1/round, effect 3]
requires signatureTechnique;
attack.energyCharges += 1;
